        "text": "Kantata OX Expertise Engine lists 177 MCP tools, including get_access_group_memberships, get_access_groups, get_account_invitations, get_account_memberships, get_assignments, get_billable_utilizations, get_billing_milestones, get_cost_rates, get_custom_app_items, get_custom_field_choices, get_custom_field_sets, and get_custom_field_values."
